 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the hill country of Seir he settled",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Away from his brother Jacob",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His possessions were too great to stay",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land could not support them",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Esau is Edom the father",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of the people in the mountains",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Magdiel Chief Iram",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "These were the chiefs of Edom",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "According to their settlements",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the land they possessed",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the daughters of Canaan he took wives",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Adah and Oholibamah",
